  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SCB Funded Risk Participation Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Debt</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a Risk Participation Agreement with Standard Chartered Bank where CDC shares SCB&apos;s exposures to identified underlying borrowers in the form of short to medium-term working capital financing and term loans in Sierra Leone.  Sectors involved include oil and gas, telecoms, manufacturing, logistics and agribusiness.  The aim of the RPA is to support economic recovery in the country following the Ebola crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
